      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَاغِيَةٌ</span></b>  fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَاغٍ</span> [q. v.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُغَآءٌ</span>
